Description:

Backup/restoreCalendars now recreates a destroyed event with each user's
private per-user data (keywords, color, transparency, alerts) stored under the
right user, so a sharee's private edits stay private.  Previously, the restore
flattened every user's private per-message annotations onto the account being
restored to.


